					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Heri venit tabellio missus ab <placeName ref="l2477">electore Palatino</placeName> ad m<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>agistratum nostrum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Is attulit filii tui ad te et <persName>Rodolphi</persName> nostri ad me <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>literas, quas mitto.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Magistratui indicavit se habuisse in vinculis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName>Adamum Neuserum</persName> Avianum; hunc elapsum forte nunc latitare <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>apud <persName ref="p4405">Brunnerum</persName>, cui olim fuerit familiaris; suspicari hoc <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>se, nil certi habere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ergo, cum <persName>Brunnerus</persName> nunc agat in ditione <placeName ref="l587">Tigurina</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>petere, ut captum transmittant <placeName ref="l210">Heydelbergam</placeName> vel in vinculis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>retineant et principi significent etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Rogatus ego, an norim <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><persName>Adamum</persName> et <persName ref="p4405">Brunnerum</persName>, exposui, quae tu quoque nosti de utroque; ostendi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p4405">Brunnerum</persName> ministrare ecclesiam sub nostro d. <persName ref="p17966">Gregorio ab Ulma</persName> etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Dimissus est hodie mane tabellio, qui festinat <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> et <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> accepturus ibi responsa eadem de re.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quid nostri <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>responderint, dicam, ubi rescivero; arbitror autem diligenter <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>suum facturos officium et hoc denunciare principi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Beldius scrip<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sit superioribus diebus generum suum <placeName ref="l760">Soloduri</placeName> fuisse ac <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ibi intellexisse <placeName ref="l832">Gallis</placeName> vehementer dolere, quod <persName>Finali</persName> sint <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eiecti ab <placeName ref="l875">Hispanis</placeName>; regem ergo legionem petiturum ab <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quam in <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontium</placeName> abducat, inde <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanum</placeName> deflectat.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Alii aiunt in <placeName>Occitana</placeName> urbes esse, quae pacem nolint <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>recipere, quas velit redigere in ordinem.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dubium mihi <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>videtur, serio an fraude res agatur; brevi certiora <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>habebimus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dominus benedicat tibi et tuis et servet vos ab <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>omni malo.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Mag ich yenen, kumm ich bald ettwan zuͦ dir.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName>Petronius Grebelius</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Matr. Marburg.</note> ist geurloupt; fritag wirt der fürschlag be<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>schähen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nostro <persName>Rodolpho</persName> nil aliud scribo quam per <persName ref="p1227">Froschouerum</persName> nos <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>scripturos de omnibus; nunc non esse otium.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">7. augusti 1571.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Tuus <persName ref="p495">Bull[inge<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>rus]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p8011">Rodolpho Gvalthero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>meo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l515">Urdorff</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
